{
  "page": {
    "title": "Chime Doorbell — motion to clip",
    "skin": "aurora",
    "protocols": {
      "rtp": {
        "label": "RTP video",
        "color": "#FFB454"
      }
    },
    "lanes": {
      "NET": {
        "color": "#38E1FF"
      },
      "DEV": {
        "color": "#FFB454"
      },
      "CAM": {
        "color": "#F471B5"
      }
    },
    "blocks": [
      {
        "heading": "Ring the doorbell — end to end",
        "accent": "cyan",
        "source": "https://github.com/doorbuzz-cloud/chime/blob/main/docs/hld.md#motion-pipeline",
        "text": [
          "The doorbell carries two chips: Sentry LP stays awake on microamps handling WiFi, MQTT, and the PIR motion sensor; Vision HP holds the camera and H.264 encoder and is powered off until Sentry wakes it over an interrupt line.",
          "One spec drives all three synchronized views: the flow board, the hardware inspector (chip wake states, board LEDs, power draw), and the viewfinder that lights up when the camera starts recording."
        ],
        "bullets": [
          "Motion events ride MQTT through Relay; video never touches the broker",
          "The high-power chip runs for seconds per visit — the power gauge shows why",
          "Clips upload to Vault over HTTPS and are linked back to the originating event"
        ],
        "contract": {
          "title": "On the wire: motion event (MQTT)",
          "source": "https://github.com/doorbuzz-cloud/chime/blob/main/docs/wire.md#motion-event",
          "fields": [
            {
              "k": "type",
              "v": "\"motion\"",
              "g": "logical event type; Relay maps it to evt/door/motion"
            },
            {
              "k": "eventId",
              "v": "0x1A2B3C4D",
              "g": "ever-increasing dedup key; Pulse drops replays",
              "hot": true,
              "link": "https://github.com/doorbuzz-cloud/chime/blob/main/fw/sentry/mqtt.c#L61"
            },
            {
              "k": "ts",
              "v": "unix ms",
              "g": "device clock, NTP-disciplined on wake"
            },
            {
              "k": "ttl",
              "v": "30s",
              "g": "broker message-expiry; stale motion is dropped",
              "link": "https://github.com/doorbuzz-cloud/chime/blob/main/services/pulse/handler.go#L88"
            }
          ],
          "note": "The clip uploaded later embeds the same eventId — that is how Vault links footage back to this event."
        },
        "diagram": {
          "view": "step",
          "groups": {
            "doorbell": {
              "title": "Chime doorbell unit"
            }
          },
          "nodes": {
